{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK plays FairPlay-protected HLS through "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DirectPlayer"},{"type":"text","text":" — the thin wrapper around"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"AVFoundation that skips the YBVR signaling and geometry stack. "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager"},{"type":"text","text":", the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pipeline behind "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/GeometryVideoView"},{"type":"text","text":" and the immersive renderers, has no DRM path at all:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nothing in it accepts a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DrmConfig"},{"type":"text","text":", so a protected stream opened through it fails to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"decrypt."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"That split is not an oversight waiting to be wired up. It follows from how protected frames","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reach the screen, which is covered below, and it decides which content can carry DRM at all.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Where-DRM-Can-Be-Used","type":"heading","text":"Where DRM Can Be Used","level":2},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Playback path"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"How frames reach the screen","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Protected content","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DirectPlayer","type":"reference"},{"text":" on iOS","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"AVPlayerLayer","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Yes","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DirectPlayer","type":"reference"},{"text":" on visionOS","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"RealityKit ","type":"text"},{"code":"VideoPlayerComponent","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, on device only"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager"},{"text":" + ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/GeometryVideoView","isActive":true}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Metal, from "},{"code":"AVPlayerItemVideoOutput","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" + "},{"code":"VisionSurfaceContext","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Metal, via Compositor Services"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" + "},{"code":"VideoPlayerComponentSurfaceContext","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"RealityKit ","type":"text"},{"code":"VideoPlayerComponent","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Not available — no API to supply a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DrmConfig"}]}]]],"header":"row","type":"table"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The rule behind the table: FairPlay decodes into a protected path that the system can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"composite but the app cannot read. Surfaces that hand the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AVPlayer"},{"text":" to the system — an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AVPlayerLayer"},{"text":", or a RealityKit ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VideoPlayerComponent"},{"text":" — therefore play protected content","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fine. The YBVR geometry renderers do the opposite: they copy each decoded frame out with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AVPlayerItemVideoOutput.copyPixelBuffer"},{"text":" and draw it onto a sphere, dome, fisheye, flat","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"panel, or control-room composition. No frames are handed out for protected content, so there","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is nothing to texture the geometry with."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In content terms:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"DRM is possible","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" for material that plays as an ordinary AVFoundation item: flat or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rectilinear video, and immersive video whose projection is described by embedded metadata","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the system itself understands (APMP, spatial, and the equirectangular kinds AVFoundation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"recognises), which "},{"code":"DirectPlayerImmersiveScene","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in the visionOS demo app projects onto a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"VideoPlayerComponent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"DRM is not possible","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for anything that depends on YBVR-side rendering: custom geometry"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from the signaling file, viewport-tiled streams, multi-camera control rooms, or camera"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"switching inside a single stream. Those need the pixel buffers FairPlay withholds."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"DRM is not possible over RTMP."}]},{"text":" Low-latency streams play through ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LowLatencyPlayer"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"which is not AVFoundation-based and has no FairPlay path, so a "},{"code":"drm","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" block on an RTMP","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stream is reported but cannot be honoured."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Configuring-DRM","text":"Configuring DRM"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The signaling file identifies the key; the certificate and license endpoints come from the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"host app. Both halves are required — a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DrmKeyManager","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" on its own does not configure","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"anything."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let player = DirectPlayer()","","player.drmConfig = DrmConfig(","    certificateURL: \"https:\/\/...\/fairplay.cer\",","    licenseURL: \"https:\/\/...\/AcquireLicense\",","    drmKeyManager: keyManager",")","","await player.open(url: streamURL)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Set ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DirectPlayer\/drmConfig","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" before ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DirectPlayer\/open(url:)"},{"type":"text","text":". Assigning it builds the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DrmManager"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"open"},{"text":" installs the platform key handler around the new item — on visionOS","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the content key session is created there — so a config assigned afterwards does not apply to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the item already loaded.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When the stream follows the convention of a sibling signaling file, the two steps collapse","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"into one call that fetches the key material and opens the stream:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["try await player.open(","    url: streamURL,","    fetchingDrmFromSignalingWith: certificateURL,","    licenseURL: licenseURL",")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Providers","level":3,"anchor":"Providers","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DrmKeyManager\/provider","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" selects the license flow: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"axinom\""},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"ybvr\""},{"type":"text","text":" are recognised,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and any other value falls back to Axinom. Both currently resolve to the Axinom provider,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"which mints a license JWT and sends it as "},{"code":"X-AxDRM-Message","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with the SPC.","type":"text"}]},{"name":"Important","type":"aside","style":"important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That JWT is minted by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DrmJWTRequest"},{"type":"text","text":" against a hardcoded development XMS"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"backend, using OAuth client credentials compiled into the SDK. DRM therefore only works"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"today against that one environment, and the credentials ship inside any binary that links"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the SDK. Treat production DRM as needing this made configurable first."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"How DRM Is Detected","level":2,"anchor":"How-DRM-Is-Detected"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Detection runs entirely off the signaling file, before playback starts. Nothing inspects the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"media playlist, so an encrypted stream whose signaling omits ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"drm"},{"type":"text","text":" is indistinguishable from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"clear content until AVFoundation asks for a key and fails.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/fetchSignalingFile(video:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" resolves the signaling version from the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"video URL: a path containing "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"_signaling_v4.json"},{"type":"text","text":" is v4, any other "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".json"},{"text":" path is v3, and","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"a media URL is v2 — where the signaling file is the same URL with its extension swapped","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for ","type":"text"},{"code":".json","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The response is decoded into ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Signaling"},{"text":" (v2), ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SignalingV3"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SignalingV4"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The caller asks the result for "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SignalingInterface\/drmKeyManager()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". A non-"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DrmKeyManager","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" means the content is protected, and both demo apps route it to"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DirectPlayer","isActive":true},{"text":" on that basis.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Content with no ","type":"text"},{"code":"drm","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" key — or with "},{"code":"\"drm\": null","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — is simply unprotected. The signaling"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"decodes normally, no DRM is reported, and the stream plays through the usual geometry","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"pipeline; this is the ordinary case for every clear title.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Decoding the block requires all three of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ekid"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keyManagerUrl"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"code":"drmProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". A block"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"that is present but missing any of them is dropped on every signaling version, leaving the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stream playable but reported as clear — so genuinely protected content then fails later at key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"time with an opaque AVFoundation error rather than a DRM-specific one. Validate the block when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"publishing. v4 logs the dropped block; v2 and v3 discard it silently."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"What each version reports today:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Signaling version"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"drm"},{"type":"text","text":" in the file"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reported by "},{"code":"drmKeyManager()","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"v2"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Decoded","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The key manager"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"v3"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Decoded"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The key manager","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"v4"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Decoded"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The key manager"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"type":"aside","style":"important","name":"Important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A signaling model that decodes "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"drm"},{"type":"text","text":" but does not implement"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SignalingInterface\/drmKeyManager()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" inherits the protocol’s default of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":", and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"silently reports protected content as clear — nothing fails to compile. ","type":"text"},{"code":"SignalingV4","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" did","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"exactly that until its accessor was added, so DRM-protected v4 streams were routed to the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"geometry pipeline where they cannot decrypt. Any new signaling version must implement that","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"requirement, and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SignalingDrmTests"},{"type":"text","text":" asserts detection through the protocol rather than the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"concrete type to keep the path covered.","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Outside the manager, "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DirectPlayer\/fetchDrmKeyManager(forStreamURL:session:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" performs the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"same lookup standalone: it swaps the stream URL’s extension for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".json"},{"text":", decodes the v2 shape,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and throws ","type":"text"},{"code":"DirectPlayerDrmError.noDrmInfoInSignaling","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" when no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"drm"},{"text":" entry is present.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Platform-Differences","text":"Platform Differences"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK ships for iOS 17+ and visionOS 26+, and each uses the key-delivery API available to it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Both share the same certificate fetch, license exchange, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DrmProvider"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS"}]},{"type":"text","text":" uses the classic "},{"code":"skd:\/\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" resource-loader flow. ","type":"text"},{"code":"ApplePlayer","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" sets itself as the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"asset’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"AVAssetResourceLoaderDelegate","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for every stream, protected or not, and forwards"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key requests to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DrmManager"},{"type":"text","text":" only when a config was supplied. Without one the request goes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unanswered and playback fails."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"visionOS"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" has never supported that flow and uses","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"AVContentKeySession(keySystem: .fairPlayStreaming)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with an ","type":"text"},{"code":"AVContentKeySessionDelegate","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The session is built during "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"open"},{"type":"text","text":" only when a config is present."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"FairPlay needs the Secure Enclave, so it does not work in the visionOS simulator —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"constructing the content key session there raises an uncatchable exception. The SDK detects","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the simulator, skips the session, and logs instead of trapping, which means protected"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"content will load but not decrypt. Verify DRM on a real Vision Pro."}]}],"name":"Note"},{"type":"heading","text":"Failure Modes","level":2,"anchor":"Failure-Modes"},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Symptom","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cause"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Protected stream plays black, or stalls at start"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Opened through "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager"},{"type":"text","text":"; the geometry pipeline has no DRM path"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Content treated as clear despite a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"drm"},{"type":"text","text":" block"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The block is missing "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ekid"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keyManagerUrl"},{"text":", or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"drmProvider"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"License request rejected"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"JWT minting failed; the error is swallowed and an empty ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"X-AxDRM-Message"},{"text":" is sent, so the CKC fetch fails","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Works on device, fails in the visionOS simulator"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Expected — FairPlay is unavailable there"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"drm"},{"text":" block is detected but never honoured","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The stream is RTMP, played by "},{"code":"LowLatencyPlayer","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which has no FairPlay path","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Where encrypted content plays, where it cannot, and how the SDK decides which it is.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"FairPlay DRM","modules":[{"name":"YBVRAppleSDK"}]},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/drm"]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/QuickStart","doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SwitchingPlayerMode"],"anchor":"Related-Documentation","title":"Related Documentation"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/ContentSwitching","doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SwitchingPlayerMode","doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/AdInsertion"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Guides","title":"Guides"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/Drm","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"article","references":{"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/YBVRPlayerManager":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"YBVRPlayer is an object that provides 